# Machines example

section Machine:

  when chord played:
    remember chord as harmony

  # low ostinato
  while harmony exists every 300ms:
    play next note from harmony
      pattern [1 3 2 4]
      octave -1
      velocity 38
      for 180ms

  # middle tremolo
  while harmony exists every random 55ms..100ms:
    play random note from harmony
      octave random -1..+1
      velocity 15..32
      for 50ms

  # occasional high echo
  while harmony exists every random 1.5s..4s:
    play random note from harmony
      octave +2
      velocity 20..45
      for 600ms

section Solo:

  when chord played notes 3..6:
    remember chord as harmony

  when note C7:
    go to section Tremolo


section Tremolo:

  when chord played notes 3..6:
    replace harmony with chord

  while harmony exists every random 45ms..90ms:
    play random note from harmony
      octave random -2..+2
      velocity 15..38
      for random 35ms..90ms

  when note C7:
    go to section Pulse


section Pulse:

  when chord played notes 3..6:
    replace harmony with chord

  while harmony exists every 180ms:
    play next note from harmony
      pattern [1 3 2 4 3 2]
      octave -1
      velocity 38
      for 100ms

  while harmony exists every random 700ms..1800ms:
    play random note from harmony
      octave +2
      velocity 20..35
      for 400ms

  when note C7:
    go to section Canon


section Canon:

  when any note:
    play +12 velocity input*0.65 after 320ms
    play -12 velocity input*0.40 after 640ms

  when note C7:
    go to section Solo